{"articleNo":"2303","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2303&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-2학기 산업(교육)대학원 무논문 석사과정 및 논문-무논문상호변경 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.08.12","hit":"15079","attachments":[{"name":"산업대학원무논문석사과정신청원(양식)1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2303&attachNo=1479"},{"name":"산업대학원무논문석사과정변경신청원1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2303&attachNo=1480"},{"name":"교육대학원무논문석사과정신청원1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2303&attachNo=1511"},{"name":"교육대학원무논문석사과정변경신청원1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2303&attachNo=1513"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 산업(교육)대학원 무논문 석사과정 신청안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2009-2학기 기준 교육(산업)대학원 3학기차 재학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 휴학으로 인해 2009-2학기에 복학 시 3학차가 되는 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2006학년도 신입생부터 적용 - 소급적용 불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2009. 8. 20(목) ～ 8. 21(금) [2일간] </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 신청장소 : 대학원 각 전공 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 신청서류 : 무논문 석사과정 신청원 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;2. 산업(교육)대학원 논문과정과 무논문과정간의 상호변경 신청안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2009-1학기 무논문석사과정 신청자 중 논문과정으로 변경하고자&nbsp;하는 4학기차(진급후) 재학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">(단, 논문과정과 무논문과정간의 상호변경은 단 1회에 한하므로 신중하게 변경하여야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2009-2학기 기준 4학차 재학생으로 무논문과정을 신규로 신청하고자&nbsp;하는 재학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(단, 4학기차 신규신청시 논문과정과 무논문과정 간의 상호변경 불가능) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2009. 8. 20(목) ~ 8. 21(금)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">[2일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 신청장소 : 대학원 각 전공 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;라. 신청서류 : 논문과정과 무논문과정간의 상호변경 신청원 1부</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
